                                                "sense_id": "1ba94e2e-4372-3587-bcaa-5114ccc4ad17",
                                                "text": "During the fast-month, zikrs are rarely performed in the Takiyahs: the inmates pray there in congregations, or they sit conversing upon benches in the shade."
                                            },
